'''Ezra and Zeb's room''' was a room inside<ref name="Fighter Flight">{{Rebels|Fighter Flight}}</ref> the modified [[VCX-100 light freighter]]<ref name="Seen a ghost?">{{SW|url=news/join-the-rebellion|text=Seen a ghost?}}</ref> ''[[Ghost]]''. The room was shared by [[Lasat]] [[Garazeb Orrelios]] "Zeb" and the human [[Ezra Bridger]], both members of the [[Spectres]] rebel cell.<ref name="Fighter Flight" />

Initially, Ezra and Zeb often argued because they had to share their room. However, after [[Attack on Imperial Troop Transports|stealing]] a [[TIE/ln space superiority starfighter|TIE fighter]] together and combatting [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Imperial Army|forces]] while pursuing [[meiloorun fruit]] for [[Hera Syndulla]], the two roommates got along much better.<ref name="Fighter Flight" />
